[{"client_msg_id":"e2c20e09-612b-48d2-aa3c-af78f79b135d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`.into_owned()` の存在を知らなかったです（むしろ `Cow` 自体の理解が浅い）。ありがとうございます","ts":"1637069867.074100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cow2","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bwIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e8d1524-5663-4a99-93c5-0419ef2fb972","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"むずかしいえーぴーあいがたくさんある","ts":"1637069865.074000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"83BXT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86c8c3e9-b6ba-4aa1-a7ad-0770ad2bbdfc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、アンダーバーはありだな","ts":"1637069799.072900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kpo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5835d3e-1108-49ed-b585-f3df59ec941c","type":"message","user":"U023FALTWDD","text":"よくわからないのですが、\u003chttps://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/borrow/enum.Cow.html#method.into_owned|Cow::into_owned\u003eとかで`String`に潰せばいいんじゃないでしょうか。\n```let current_version =\n    String::from_utf8_lossy(\u0026amp;Command::new(\"rustc\").arg(\"-V\").output().unwrap().stdout)\n        .into_owned();\nlet _: String = current_version;```\n`Ok`時のコピーをなくしたければこうですね (外部コマンドを呼び出すようなレイヤーでこんなことをする必要はないと思いますが)\n```let current_version =\n    String::from_utf8(Command::new(\"rustc\").arg(\"-V\").output().unwrap().stdout)\n        .unwrap_or_else(|e| String::from_utf8_lossy(e.as_bytes()).into_owned());\nlet _: String = current_version;```\nあと私はよくこういうことをしますね。これで変数の数は増えないので。\n```let current_version = \u0026amp;Command::new(\"rustc\").arg(\"-V\").output().unwrap().stdout;\nlet current_version = \u0026amp;String::from_utf8_lossy(current_version);\nlet _: \u0026amp;Cow\u0026lt;str\u0026gt; = current_version;\nlet _: \u0026amp;str = current_version;```","ts":"1637069750.072400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Cow in std::borrow - Rust","id":1,"title":"Cow in std::borrow - Rust","title_link":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/borrow/enum.Cow.html#method.into_owned","text":"A clone-on-write smart pointer.","blocks":null,"service_name":"doc.rust-lang.org","service_icon":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/borrow/enum.Cow.html#method.into_owned","original_url":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/borrow/enum.Cow.html#method.into_owned"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OKkPJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a91ba7b7-bb56-4db3-a214-972e3a1e9cce","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これのパフォーマンスを気にするようなプログラムを書く機会、そうそう来ないだろうな","ts":"1637066060.067600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GPYeQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ce511f2-c6cd-48d3-aed2-64624c4a7227","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"今回はパフォーマンス気にするような物じゃないのでよし","ts":"1637066037.066900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hg7Ns"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5941cca-2631-45bf-9d40-0075300c5875","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"パフォーマンス的にどちらが良いか、とかは私には分からないので悪しからず。","ts":"1637065988.066500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hjhb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21d4d8b2-c143-49b4-acd6-93b6e1fc45c6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"この手の状況だとlossy使うべきではないということか:rikai:","ts":"1637065647.063300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8k7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d3aba78-95db-423a-800e-ea56db90829d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"たとえばこれが `String::from_utf8(result).unwrap()` なら大丈夫なんですけどね","ts":"1637065596.062700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cTG6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ebca514-d076-4aac-8e71-b277545e563e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"だめみたいですね","ts":"1637065451.062000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HYp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7bf895e-9168-4e7c-b55e-e30aadda41eb","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あー、でも `String::from_utf8_lossy` は `Cow\u0026lt;str\u0026gt;` を返すからそのまま\n```    let current_version = {\n        let result = Command::new(\"rustc\").arg(\"-V\").output().unwrap().stdout;\n        String::from_utf8_lossy(\u0026amp;result)\n    };```\nとかだと通らないのか…","ts":"1637065402.061300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RPv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb348179-ddcb-444b-b1bf-c7b10a732b2e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Goで書いてた自動ビルドbotを移植している","ts":"1637065242.060700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qHa4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42e03a3a-2f68-44fa-8649-d2c08b93da04","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"じゃんじゃん書こう","ts":"1637065209.060400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KAddQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25f852ae-fd35-49a4-bca6-b4e82595fe43","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"最近、既存の何かを移植すると死ににくいことに気付いた","ts":"1637065205.060200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r51y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15950dff-a815-4e80-a952-99dd8b4ca0ed","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それはそれとして私もいい加減 Rust 書きたい","ts":"1637065182.059800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ioz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c1f43bb-f918-4bb0-97ef-6196f4758c6e","type":"message","use